module shapes
edition 0
needs console


a Shape is one of:
    circle with a radius (a number)
    rectangle with a width (a number) and a height (a number)


to area of s (a Shape) giving a number:
    match s:
        when circle with radius ?r:
            give back 3 times r times r
        when rectangle with width ?w and height ?h, if w equals h:
            give back w times w
        when rectangle with width ?w and height ?h:
            give back w times h


to main, needs console:
    for each s in [circle with radius 2, rectangle with width 3 and height 3, rectangle with width 2 and height 5]:
        show area of s
